                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From a mechanical point of view."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6f21bc4-88d7-4250-9a67-34f75cbfeab7",
                                                "sense_id": "7e29108d-131e-3b9a-b1b4-b33a5a2e60fa",
                                                "text": "mechanically speaking"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b497a6be-58a1-3d95-b5bb-fe9fd1b3f4e7",
                                        "entry_id": "43b06ea9-338d-32c0-9f39-1ba346161259",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a mechanical manner, mindlessly, thoughtlessly, automatically, without thinking."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7e6f49a-92af-4c95-9dd0-b23a2e8fd12a",
                                                "sense_id": "b497a6be-58a1-3d95-b5bb-fe9fd1b3f4e7",
                                                "text": "My fears, however, made me mechanically close my thighs; but the very touch of his hand insinuated between them, disclosed them and opened a way for the main attack.",
                                                "translation": "Fanny Hill",
                                                "english": "Fanny Hill"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33e20d62-7b37-49e6-a904-f1998feb90db",
                                                "sense_id": "b497a6be-58a1-3d95-b5bb-fe9fd1b3f4e7",
                                                "text": "\"Of what avail,\" and her eyes wandered mechanically round, \"is all the luxury by which I am surrounded, if it serve only as a barrier to all kindly feelings?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "311670a5-267d-4537-9c01-2fbf68b830f0",
                                                "sense_id": "b497a6be-58a1-3d95-b5bb-fe9fd1b3f4e7",
                                                "text": "Provided they stick to their legal priors, rather than voting mechanically as Republican appointees, the justices seem likely to split on some of these cases — with real consequences for Trump’s agenda."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a57a41cd-fbab-43b2-8d6f-3bdf8c69e2b0",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb753a4e-a58e-3997-b539-31fa15f1c425",
